      "problem": "$$\n\n$\\operatorname{artanh}⁡(-\\frac{15}{17})=$",
      "worked_solution": "The definition of $\\operatorname{artanh}⁡x$ is \n\n$$\n\\operatorname{artanh}⁡x=\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{ln}⁡(\\frac{1+x}{1-x}).\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{artanh}⁡(-\\frac{15}{17}) & =\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{ln}⁡(\\frac{1+(-\\frac{15}{17})}{1-(-\\frac{15}{17})}) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{ln}⁡(\\frac{1-\\frac{15}{17}}{1+\\frac{15}{17}}) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{ln}⁡(\\frac{\\frac{2}{15}}{\\frac{32}{15}}) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{ln}⁡(\\frac{1}{16}) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{ln}⁡{2}^{-4} \\\\  & =-2\\operatorname{ln}⁡2.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
